ess','testing','any']::text[], 'The floor is filling with smoke. Intel has the floor plan, Scout knows where you are and where the exit is, Decoder knows how you may move. How many steps is the shortest way out?', '{"intel":{"title":"Floor plan (⬛ = blocked)","body":"   A B C D E F\n1 ⬜⬛⬜⬛⬜⬜\n2 ⬜⬜⬛⬜⬜⬛\n3 ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜\n4 ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜\n5 ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬛","big":true},"scout":{"title":"Where you are","body":"You are at A1. The exit is at F3."},"decoder":{"title":"How you may move","body":"One step = one square up, down, left or right. No diagonal steps. You cannot step on a blocked square."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Fewest steps to the exit","accept":["7"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Intel: read the plan row by row. Count steps from the start, square by square, like a flood spreading.', 'A1 → F3 in 7 steps', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-route-1', 'route', 'mission', 'Escape Route', 'logic', 1, array['office','phase2','access','testing','any']::text[], 'The floor is filling with smoke. Intel has the floor plan, Scout knows where you are and where the exit is, Decoder knows how you may move. How many steps is the shortest way out?', '{"intel":{"title":"Floor plan (⬛ = blocked)","body":"   A B C D E F\n1 ⬛⬛⬜⬜⬛⬜\n2 ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜\n3 ⬜⬛⬜⬜⬜⬛\n4 ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜\n5 ⬜⬛⬜⬜⬛⬜","big":true},"scout":{"title":"Where you are","body":"You are at A2. The exit is at F4."},"decoder":{"title":"How you may move","body":"One step = one square up, down, left or right. No diagonal steps. You cannot step on a blocked square."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Fewest steps to the exit","accept":["7"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Intel: read the plan row by row. Count steps from the start, square by square, like a flood spreading.', 'A2 → F4 in 7 steps', null, 25, 'published'), ('mission-route-2', 'route', 'mission', 'Escape Route', 'logic', 1, array['office','phase2','access','testing','any']::text[], 'The floor is filling with smoke. Intel has the floor plan, Scout knows where you are and where the exit is, Decoder knows how you may move. How ma